{"v":[{"a":["ٱلۡقَارِعَةُ"],"t":"The Shocker","l":"Al-Qari`ahu","w":[["al-qāriʿatu","The Striking Calamity"]]},{"a":["مَا","ٱلۡقَارِعَةُ"],"t":"What is the Shocker","l":"Ma Al-Qari`ahu","w":[["mā","What"],["l-qāriʿatu","(is) the Striking Calamity"]]},{"a":["وَمَآ","أَدۡرَىٰكَ","مَا","ٱلۡقَارِعَةُ"],"t":"What will explain to you what the Shocker is","l":"Wa Ma 'Adraka Ma Al-Qari`ahu","w":[["wamā","And what"],["adrāka","will make you know"],["mā","what"],["l-qāriʿatu","(is) the Striking Calamity"]]},{"a":["يَوۡمَ","يَكُونُ","ٱلنَّاسُ","كَٱلۡفَرَاشِ","ٱلۡمَبۡثُوثِ"],"t":"The Day when the people will be like scattered moths","l":"Yawma Yakunu An-Nasu Kalfarashi Al-Mabthuthi","w":[["yawma","(The) Day"],["yakūnu","will be"],["l-nāsu","the mankind"],["kal-farāshi","like moths"],["l-mabthūthi","scattered"]]},{"a":["وَتَكُونُ","ٱلۡجِبَالُ","كَٱلۡعِهۡنِ","ٱلۡمَنفُوشِ"],"t":"And the mountains will be like tufted wool","l":"Wa Takunu Al-Jibalu Kal`ihni Al-Manfushi","w":[["watakūnu","And will be"],["l-jibālu","the mountains"],["kal-ʿih'ni","like wool"],["l-manfūshi","fluffed up"]]},{"a":["فَأَمَّا","مَن","ثَقُلَتۡ","مَوَٰزِينُهُۥ"],"t":"As for he whose scales are heavy","l":"Fa'amma Man Thaqulat Mawazinuhu","w":[["fa-ammā","Then as for"],["man","(him) whose"],["thaqulat","(are) heavy"],["mawāzīnuhu","his scales"]]},{"a":["فَهُوَ","فِي","عِيشَةٖ","رَّاضِيَةٖ"],"t":"He will be in a pleasant life","l":"Fahuwa Fi `Ishatin Rađiyahin","w":[["fahuwa","Then he"],["fī","(will be) in"],["ʿīshatin","a life"],["rāḍiyatin","pleasant"]]},{"a":["وَأَمَّا","مَنۡ","خَفَّتۡ","مَوَٰزِينُهُۥ"],"t":"But as for he whose scales are light","l":"Wa 'Amma Man Khaffat Mawazinuhu","w":[["wa-ammā","But as for"],["man","(him) whose"],["khaffat","(are) light"],["mawāzīnuhu","his scales"]]},{"a":["فَأُمُّهُۥ","هَاوِيَةٞ"],"t":"His home is the Abyss","l":"Fa'ummuhu Hawiyahun","w":[["fa-ummuhu","His abode"],["hāwiyatun","(will be the) Pit"]]},{"a":["وَمَآ","أَدۡرَىٰكَ","مَا","هِيَهۡ"],"t":"Do you know what it 